      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'm mostly worried about the transfers though. if i take the train, how much extra time should i buffer for switching lines or dealing with delays? and as for the cost, is a jr pass even worth it for just those three cities or is it cheaper to just buy individual tickets?",
